From 0a90f62dbe3c2c8c285e9a5caaa4fef1835ff9d8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dixonSolutions <203963471+dixonSolutions@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 15:07:37 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 01/18] exynos-mobile: initial SM-T570 (gtactive3wifi, Exynos
 9810) support

UFS PHY/host ops for 9810, 9810 pinctrl, USB DRD PHY PMU offset,
dwc3-generic exynos9810 compatible, board entry with 9810 DRAM banks,
MAX77705 COM_USB switch via bit-banged I2C, gtactive3wifi_defconfig.
Also fixes a missing inttypes.h include in tools/amlimage.c.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
